                                "sense_id": "77731c72-01ea-3b06-bf1c-035cb7118875",
                                "text": "The possible protective effects of ferritin and reticulose are being studied."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7ac081f-924c-4b01-90d7-b8f246f7a774",
                                "sense_id": "77731c72-01ea-3b06-bf1c-035cb7118875",
                                "text": "Recently, reticulose has been described as an immune system modulator, and early clinical studies have shown that reticuose has an ability to rapidly inhibit the course of a variety of viral diseases, particularly in the acute stage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dda2b571-11b4-41d3-ac71-2212dcde0c82",
                                "sense_id": "77731c72-01ea-3b06-bf1c-035cb7118875",
                                "text": "There have been other drugs since reticulose that I became aware of the successes of, some even able to claim \"cure,\" even turning people from HIV-positive to negative."
